egal, ob wir Pizza oder Pasta <b>essen</b>.</div>ob 문장에서도 동사가 맨 끝이에요.<br>Es ist mir egal은 18과의 3격 표현이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Warum kommst du nicht mit? — <span class=\"qblank\"></span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Denn ich noch arbeiten muss.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Weil ich noch arbeiten muss.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Weil ich muss noch arbeiten.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Weil muss ich noch arbeiten.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Warum 질문에는 weil 문장만으로 답할 수 있어요. 화법조동사 muss가 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Da&quot;,&quot;Weil&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(이유)</span> heute Feiertag ist, haben die Geschäfte zu.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘이 공휴일이라서 가게들이 문을 닫았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Da</b> heute Feiertag ist, haben die Geschäfte zu.</div>이유를 앞에 말할 때는 da나 weil이에요.<br>종속절이 앞이라 주문장은 동사 haben부터예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Falls&quot;,&quot;Wenn&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> du den Bus verpasst, ruf mich an!</div><div class=\"qko\">혹시 버스를 놓치면 전화해!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Falls</b> du den Bus verpasst, ruf mich an!</div>'혹시 ~하면'은 falls예요. wenn도 돼요.<br>주문장이 명령문이라 ruf가 바로 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dass&quot;],[&quot;das&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Ich hoffe, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Wetter · 중성)</span> Wetter morgen schön ist.</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 날씨가 좋기를 바라요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich hoffe, <b>dass</b> <b>das</b> Wetter morgen schön ist.</div>'~라는 것'은 접속사 dass, 중성 관사는 das예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wissen Sie, wie lange die Bibliothek heute offen hat?&quot;,&quot;Wissen Sie, wie lange heute die Bibliothek offen hat?&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">도서관이 오늘 얼마나 오래 여는지 아세요?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">wie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">offen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Sie,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Wissen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">lange</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">hat?</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Bibliothek</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">heute</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wissen Sie, wie lange die Bibliothek heute offen hat?</b></div>정중한 질문은 간접의문문으로 해요.<br>wie lange 뒤에 주어, 동사 hat은 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;indem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Ich lerne Vokabeln, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(방법)</span> ich sie auf Karten schreibe.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 단어를 카드에 써서 외워요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich lerne Vokabeln, <b>indem</b> ich sie auf Karten schreibe.</div>'~함으로써'(방법)는 indem이에요.<br>damit은 목적이라 여기에 맞지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;so&quot;],[&quot;dass&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Die Musik war <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> laut, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> wir uns nicht verstanden haben.</div><div class=\"qko\">음악이 너무 시끄러워서 우리는 서로 알아듣지 못했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Musik war <b>so</b> laut, <b>dass</b> wir uns nicht verstanden haben.</div>so + 형용사, dass + 결과예요.<br>dass 문장에서 보조 동사 haben이 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Ich komme gern zu deiner Party, es sei denn, <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. (야간 근무가 있는 경우만 빼고)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) ich habe Nachtdienst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) habe ich Nachtdienst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ich Nachtdienst habe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dass ich habe Nachtdienst</button></div><div class=\"qe\">es sei denn 뒤 문장은 종속절이 아니라서 동사가 둘째 자리예요.<br>dass를 넣으면 dass ich Nachtdienst habe가 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Obwohl ich früh aufgestanden bin, habe ich den Bus verpasst.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">일찍 일어났는데도 버스를 놓쳤어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">verpasst.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Obwohl</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">aufgestanden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">bin,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">früh</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">Bus</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Obwohl ich früh aufgestanden bin, habe ich den Bus verpasst.</b></div>obwohl 문장은 bin이 맨 끝이에요.<br>종속절이 앞이라 주문장은 habe부터 시작해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> '그녀가 나를 기억하는지 확실하지 않아요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ich bin nicht sicher, ob sie sich an mich erinnert.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich bin nicht sicher, ob sich an mich sie erinnert.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich bin nicht sicher, ob sie erinnert sich an mich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich bin nicht sicher, wenn sie sich an mich erinnert.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'~인지'는 ob이에요. ob 뒤에 주어, 재귀대명사, 전치사구, 동사 순서예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> Der Lehrer schreibt die Wörter an die Tafel, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> die Schüler sie abschreiben können.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) damit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ob</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) indem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) obwohl</button></div><div class=\"qe\">학생들이 베껴 쓸 수 있도록 하는 목적이라서 damit이에요.<br>indem은 방법이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Soweit&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ich weiß, wohnt sie jetzt in Leipzig.</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 아는 한 그녀는 지금 라이프치히에 살아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Soweit</b> ich weiß, wohnt sie jetzt in Leipzig.</div>'내가 아는 한'은 soweit ich weiß예요.<br>종속절이 앞이라 주문장은 동사 wohnt부터예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ob&quot;],[&quot;weil&quot;,&quot;da&quot;],[&quot;Wenn&quot;,&quot;Falls&quot;],[&quot;komme&quot;],[&quot;wann&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Hallo Tom,<br>ich weiß nicht, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ich am Samstag kommen kann. Ich muss vielleicht arbeiten, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> meine Kollegin krank ist. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> sie wieder gesund ist, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(kommen)</span> ich natürlich! Sag mir bitte, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"> die Party beginnt.</div><div class=\"qko\">톰, 토요일에 갈 수 있을지 모르겠어. 동료가 아파서 일해야 할지도 몰라. 동료가 다시 건강해지면 당연히 갈게! 파티가 언제 시작하는지 알려 줘.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hallo Tom,<br>ich weiß nicht, <b>ob</b> ich am Samstag kommen kann. Ich muss vielleicht arbeiten, <b>weil</b> meine Kollegin krank ist. <b>Wenn</b> sie wieder gesund ist, <b>komme</b> ich natürlich! Sag mir bitte, <b>wann</b> die Party beginnt.</div>'~인지'는 ob, 이유는 weil이에요.<br>Wenn 문장이 앞에 와서 주문장은 동사 komme부터예요. '언제'를 문장 속에 넣으면 wann이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ich finde, dass der Film ist zu lang.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich finde, der Film ist zu lang.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich frage mich, ob das stimmt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Dass du anrufst, freut mich.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">dass가 있으면 동사가 끝이에요 — dass der Film zu lang ist.<br>dass를 빼면 주문장 어순이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich frage mich, warum er sich nicht bei mir entschuldigt hat.&quot;,&quot;Ich frage mich, warum er sich bei mir nicht entschuldigt hat.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그가 왜 나에게 사과하지 않았는지 궁금해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">mir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hat.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">frage</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">warum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">sich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">mich,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">entschuldigt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">bei</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich frage mich, warum er sich nicht bei mir entschuldigt hat.</b></div>간접의문문: 의문사 + 주어 + 재귀대명사 … 과거분사 + 보조 동사(맨 끝).<br>sich entschuldigen bei는 18과의 전치사 동사예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wir essen auf der Terrasse, außer wenn es stark regnet.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Wir essen auf der Terrasse, außer wenn es regnet stark.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wir essen auf der Terrasse, es sei denn, dass es stark regnet.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wir essen auf der Terrasse, es sei denn, es regnet stark.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">außer wenn 뒤는 종속절이라 동사 regnet가 맨 끝이어야 해요.<br>es sei denn 뒤는 주문장 어순, dass를 넣으면 동사가 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ob&quot;],[&quot;angefangen&quot;],[&quot;hat&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> Hat das Spiel schon angefangen? → Weißt du, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> das Spiel schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(anfangen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">경기가 벌써 시작했는지 알아?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hat das Spiel schon angefangen? → Weißt du, <b>ob</b> das Spiel schon <b>angefangen</b> <b>hat</b>?</div>예/아니요 질문은 ob으로 넣어요.<br>현재완료는 과거분사 다음에 보조 동사가 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> Wie hat Jana so gut Deutsch gelernt? — <span class=\"qblank\"></span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Sodass sie jeden Tag Podcasts gehört hat.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Damit sie jeden Tag Podcasts gehört hat.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Dadurch, sie hat jeden Tag Podcasts gehört.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Dadurch, dass sie jeden Tag Podcasts gehört hat.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'어떻게'에 대한 대답은 방법이에요 — dadurch, dass.<br>damit은 목적, sodass는 결과예요. dass 뒤에서는 동사가 끝이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"32\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 32</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"